WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.320
Every day is always worse with those little girls

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:06.720
Who disturb us during walks

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:09.760
But what can we do if they follow us?

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:12.280
Oh oh oh oh oh oh

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:15.840
Silvia, come on, think about it

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:18.880
Because you can't do it anymore

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:22.480
We know you'll never give up

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:25.760
Fight the decline until you do it

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:29.000
Silvia, you'll save your Milan

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.320
And you will free us from the criminals
